# 🍽️ ADDIS EATS — Ethiopian Restaurant App

A responsive restaurant web application for **ADDIS EATS**, an Ethiopian restaurant. The app loads menu data from a JSON file, allows customers to search and filter dishes, manage a shopping cart, calculate the total price in Ethiopian Birr (ETB), and complete an order using a validated checkout form.

## 🚀 Features

* 🍛 Ethiopian restaurant menu
* 📱 Responsive design for mobile and desktop
* 🖼️ Restaurant logo and hero background image
* 📦 Menu data loaded from `data/menu.json`
* ⏳ Loading state while menu data is being fetched
* ❌ Error handling when menu data cannot be loaded
* 🔎 Live menu search/filter
* 🛒 Add items to cart
* ➕ Increase item quantity
* ➖ Decrease item quantity
* 🗑️ Remove items from cart
* 💰 Live cart total in ETB
* 🔢 Live cart item count
* 💾 Cart persistence using `localStorage`
* 🔄 Cart restored after page reload
* 📝 Checkout form
* 👤 Customer name validation
* 📞 Ethiopian phone/TeleBirr validation using regex
* 📍 Delivery area selection
* 🛍️ Empty-cart validation before checkout
* ✅ Order confirmation message

