## 🍛 Menu Data

Menu information is stored in:

```text
data/menu.json
```

Example:

```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Kitfo",
  "price": 700,
  "category": "Beef",
  "image": "./images/kitfo.jpg",
  "description": "Traditional minced beef seasoned with Ethiopian spices."
}
```

The application loads the menu using:

```javascript
const response = await fetch("./data/menu.json");
```

