## 💾 Local Storage

The shopping cart is saved to the browser's local storage.

```javascript
localStorage.setItem(
  "addisEatsCart",
  JSON.stringify(state.cart)
);
```

When the application starts, it loads the saved cart:

```javascript
const savedCart =
  JSON.parse(
    localStorage.getItem("addisEatsCart")
  );
```

This means the customer's cart remains available after refreshing or reopening the page.

