## 📞 Phone Validation

The application validates Ethiopian phone numbers using:

```javascript
const ETHIOPIAN_PHONE_REGEX =
  /^(?:\+251|0)9\d{8}$/;
```

Valid examples:

```text
0912345678
+251912345678
```

Invalid examples:

```text
123456789
0812345678
091234
```

---

## ✅ Checkout Validation

Before an order can be placed, the application checks:

### 1. Name

The customer must provide a name with at least two characters.

### 2. Phone

The phone number must match the Ethiopian phone regex.

### 3. Cart

The cart cannot be empty.

If all validations pass, the application:

```text
Validate form
      ↓
Calculate total
      ↓
Show order confirmation
      ↓
Clear cart
      ↓
Save empty cart
      ↓
Render updated UI
```

