## 🔐 Validation Example

The checkout validation follows this pattern:

```javascript
if (!name) {
  // show name error
}

if (!ETHIOPIAN_PHONE_REGEX.test(phone)) {
  // show phone error
}

if (state.cart.length === 0) {
  // show cart error
}
```

The form uses:

```html
novalidate
```

so that JavaScript controls the validation messages and provides consistent feedback to the customer.

