## 📱 Responsive Design

The application is designed mobile-first.

The menu uses CSS Grid:

```css
.menu-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns:
    repeat(
      auto-fit,
      minmax(220px, 1fr)
    );
}
```

This allows menu cards to automatically rearrange based on the available screen width.

The application works on:

* 📱 Mobile phones
* 📱 Tablets
* 💻 Laptops
* 🖥️ Desktop screens

